### Colours \'97 exact hex values, never change\
| Token | Hex | Used for |\
|---|---|---|\
| `--chartreuse` | `#c0d726` | Hero backgrounds, chartreuse sections, highlight wipes |\
| `--coral` | `#F26B5B` | Stat counters, scroll progress bar, secondary buttons, accent links |\
| `--charcoal` | `#373838` | Dark sections, navbar, primary buttons, body text |\
