## Editing content\
\
- **Homepage copy** \'97 edit `index.html` directly\
- **About page copy** \'97 edit `about.html` directly\
- **FAQ questions and answers** \'97 edit the accordion items in `faqs.html`\
- **Stat counter numbers** \'97 change `data-to="XXXX"` on the `.counter` spans\
- **Colours** \'97 change token values in the `:root` block in `we-v3.4-base.css`\
- **Fonts** \'97 do not change without a full brand review\
